    <bpmn:process id="W_W4841" name="W4841. Regulatory License/Permit Portfolio Strategy &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program launch; annual compliance strategy review; entity/site expansion; major regulatory change
Frequency: Annual + on trigger
Volume: 1 group portfolio strategy; ~thousands of authorizations across ~205 sites
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Chief Compliance Officer / Compliance Portfolio Manager
Participants: COO, Store Ops (VS-07), Real Estate (VS-97), Tax (VS-79), HSE (VS-24), HR (VS-19), Government Affairs (VS-104), Internal Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4841 — Regulatory License/Permit Portfolio Strategy &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4841_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4841_Lane1" name="Compliance Portfolio Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4841_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4841_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4841_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4841_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4841_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4841_Start3" name="Program launch; annual compliance strategy review; entity/site expansion; major…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4841_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4841_Task4" name="Set the portfolio strategy &amp; operating model: centralized compliance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the portfolio strategy &amp; operating model: centralized compliance center-of-excellence vs distributed domain-ownership with central oversight (the federated model), the single-source-of-truth register, governance/RACI, the renewal engine, and the compliance dashboard; decide make-vs-buy for permit services
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio Manager / Legal / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4841_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4841_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4841_Task5" name="Define the portfolio scope &amp; taxonomy: all…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Define the portfolio scope &amp; taxonomy: all license/permit/certification/accreditation classes (LGU, BFP, DENR, BIR/CAS, DTI-BPS, PCAB, PhilGEPS, FDA/FPA/BPI, PEZA/BOI, SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG, DOLE, LTO/LTFRB, BSP, customs, NPC, energy, signage/occupancy) and the per-class data model (entity, site, regulator, expiry, owner, fee, evidence, conditions, risk)
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio Manager / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4841_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4841_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4841_Task6" name="Approve the strategy, integrate into the enterprise compliance plan (VS-22) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Approve the strategy, integrate into the enterprise compliance plan (VS-22) and ERM (VS-21.2), resource the function, and set KPIs (coverage %, on-time-renewal %, lapse incidents, penalty $, inspection findings); report to the board/audit &amp; risk committee (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio Manager / Strategy / Risk
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CFO / Board Audit &amp; Risk Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4841_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4841_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4841_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4841_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-169 (ensure enterprise license/permit register integrity.) | - CTL-728: single-source-of-truth register; ownership matrix; board-reported KPIs
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Chief Compliance Officer / Compliance Portfolio Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4841_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4841_Annotation8" targetRef="W4841_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4841_Flow10" sourceRef="W4841_Start3" targetRef="W4841_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4841_Flow11" sourceRef="W4841_Task4" targetRef="W4841_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4841_Flow12" sourceRef="W4841_Task5" targetRef="W4841_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4841_Flow13" sourceRef="W4841_Task6" targetRef="W4841_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4841_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4841_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4841">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4841_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4841_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
