    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4842" name="W4842. Unified License/Permit/Accreditation Inventory &amp; Register Build" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program launch (W4841); new site/entity; discovery of an un-inventoried authorization
Frequency: Initial build + continuous maintenance
Volume: ~thousands of authorizations; ~205 sites × multiple classes
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Compliance Operations
Participants: All domain compliance owners (VS-22/76/79/114/117/138/145/165/46/06), Master Data (VS-29), Records (VS-88)
Source: workflow W4842 — Unified License/Permit/Accreditation Inventory &amp; Register Build</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4842_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4842_Lane1" name="Compliance Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4842_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4842_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4842_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4842_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4842_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4842_Start3" name="Program launch (W4841); new site/entity; discovery of an un-inventoried authorization">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4842_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4842_Task4" name="Build the unified register: harvest every existing authorization from domain…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the unified register: harvest every existing authorization from domain owners (LGU business permits, BFP FSIC, DENR ECC, BIR/CAS/ATP, DTI-BPS, PCAB, PhilGEPS, SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG, DOLE, LTO/LTFRB, BSP, NPC, etc.), normalize to the taxonomy (W4841), and load with full metadata (entity, site, regulator, license #, issue/expiry, owner, fee, evidence-link, conditions, renewal-rule)
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Domain Owners / Master Data
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Initial build (weeks–months)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4842_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4842_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4842_Task5" name="Reconcile &amp; de-duplicate: cross-check the register against finance (fee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Reconcile &amp; de-duplicate: cross-check the register against finance (fee payments VS-17), records (VS-88), and regulator portals; resolve duplicates, gaps, and stale entries; link each to the site/entity master (VS-29) and the domain compliance VS
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Master Data / Finance / Records
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Initial + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4842_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4842_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4842_Task6" name="Maintain continuously: register is the single source of truth, updated on every…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Maintain continuously: register is the single source of truth, updated on every issuance/renewal/lapse/variation (W4849–W4856); enforce the data-quality standard and the update SLA from domain owners; report register-health to governance (W4864)
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Domain Owners
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4842_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4842_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4842_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4842_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-169 (ensure enterprise license/permit register integrity.) | - CTL-728: single-source-of-truth register; reconciled to finance/records/portals; data-quality standard enforced
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Compliance Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4842_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4842_Annotation8" targetRef="W4842_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4842_Flow10" sourceRef="W4842_Start3" targetRef="W4842_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4842_Flow11" sourceRef="W4842_Task4" targetRef="W4842_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4842_Flow12" sourceRef="W4842_Task5" targetRef="W4842_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4842_Flow13" sourceRef="W4842_Task6" targetRef="W4842_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
