Frequency: Continuous + on audit
Volume: All authorization documents (~thousands)
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Records (VS-88)
Participants: Domain owners, Legal (VS-100.3), Finance, Internal Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4846 — Evidence Repository, Document-of-Record &amp; Audit Trail</bpmn:documentation>
