      <bpmn:userTask id="W4846_Task4" name="Maintain the evidence repository linked to the register (W4842): for every…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the evidence repository linked to the register (W4842): for every authorization, the certificate, application, renewal filings, fee receipts, conditions, correspondence, and inspection/penalty records — retained per BIR/NIRC 10-year and records (VS-88) rules; enforce document-of-record standard
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Records
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4846_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4846_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4846_Task5" name="Maintain the audit trail: every authorization lifecycle event…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain the audit trail: every authorization lifecycle event (issue/renew/lapse/vary/inspect/penalty) timestamped with owner and evidence; reconcile to the register (W4842) and finance fee payments (VS-17)
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Records / Finance
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4846_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4846_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4846_Task6" name="On audit/regulator request (W4852/W4860), produce evidence packets; support…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On audit/regulator request (W4852/W4860), produce evidence packets; support internal audit (VS-21) control testing; manage retention/disposal per VS-88; report evidence-completeness to governance (W4864)
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Records / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Per audit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4846_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
